@export Whether the accused takes or seeks gratification or restitution in consideration of screening an offender (s 213 of the Penal Code 1871, read with its Exception)
GIVEN f IS A `Screening Gift Facts` @desc What gratification or restitution was taken, given or offered, and in consideration of what
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `takes a gift to screen an offender` f IF
        "Whoever"
    AND f's `accepts, agrees to accept, or attempts to obtain any gratification or restitution of property for himself or any other person`
    AND f's `in consideration of concealing an offence, screening any person from legal punishment for it, or not proceeding against any person to bring him to legal punishment`
    AND NOT f's `the offence may lawfully be compounded`

@export Whether the accused has committed an offence punishable under section 213 of the Penal Code 1871 (taking gifts to screen an offender from punishment)
GIVEN f IS A `Screening Gift Facts` @desc What gratification or restitution was taken, given or offered, and in consideration of what
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `offence under s 213` f IF
        "Whoever"
    AND `takes a gift to screen an offender` f
    AND (f's `the offence is punishable with death` OR f's `the offence is punishable with imprisonment for life or with imprisonment which may extend to 20 years` OR f's `the offence is punishable with imprisonment not extending to 20 years`)

@export Frame a charge under section 213 of the Penal Code 1871 (taking gifts to screen an offender from punishment), or say why none can be framed
GIVEN f IS A `Screening Gift Facts` @desc What gratification or restitution was taken, given or offered, and in consideration of what, and the particulars of the charge
GIVETH A Charge
`charge under s 213` f MEANS
    `frame the charge` (f's particulars) "213" "taking gifts to screen an offender from punishment"
        (IF f's `the offence is punishable with death` THEN (`punishment prescribed by s 213(a)`)'s words ELSE IF f's `the offence is punishable with imprisonment for life or with imprisonment which may extend to 20 years` THEN (`punishment prescribed by s 213(b)`)'s words ELSE (`punishment prescribed by s 213(c)`)'s words)
        (`offence under s 213` f)
        (CONCAT "did accept, agree to accept or attempt to obtain gratification or restitution of property in consideration of concealing an offence, namely ", f's `the offence`, ", or of screening a person from legal punishment for it", (`to wit` (f's `what was done`)))
        (concat (LIST
                (`missing unless` (f's `accepts, agrees to accept, or attempts to obtain any gratification or restitution of property for himself or any other person`) "accepts, or agrees to accept, or attempts to obtain any gratification or restitution of property"),
                (`missing unless` (f's `in consideration of concealing an offence, screening any person from legal punishment for it, or not proceeding against any person to bring him to legal punishment`) "in consideration of concealing an offence, screening any person from legal punishment, or not proceeding against any person"),
                (`missing unless` (NOT f's `the offence may lawfully be compounded`) "not a case in which the offence may lawfully be compounded (Exception)"),
                (`missing unless` ((f's `the offence is punishable with death` OR f's `the offence is punishable with imprisonment for life or with imprisonment which may extend to 20 years` OR f's `the offence is punishable with imprisonment not extending to 20 years`)) "the offence is punishable with death, with imprisonment for life or up to 20 years, or where it is punishable with imprisonment not extending to 20 years"),
                (`missing unless` (`takes a gift to screen an offender` f) "the elements of section 213 taken together")))

§§ `s 214 - Offering gift or restoration of property in consideration of screening offender`

-- 214. Whoever gives or causes, or offers or agrees to give or cause, any
-- gratification to any person, or to restore or cause the restoration of any property
-- to any person, in consideration of that person's concealing an offence, or of his
-- screening any person from legal punishment for any offence, or of his not proceeding
-- against any person for the purpose of bringing him to legal punishment, shall -
--    (a) if the offence is punishable with death, be punished with imprisonment for a
--      term which may extend to 10 years, and shall also be liable to fine;
--    (b) if the offence is punishable with imprisonment for life, or with imprisonment
--      which may extend to 20 years, shall be punished with imprisonment for a term
--      which may extend to 7 years, and shall also be liable to fine; and
--    (c) if the offence is punishable with imprisonment not extending to 20 years,
--      shall be punished with imprisonment for a term which may extend to one- fourth
--      part of the longest term of imprisonment provided for that offence, or with fine,
--      or with both.
-- Exceptions.-Sections 213 and 214 do not extend to any case in which the offence may
-- lawfully be compounded.

