GIVEN f IS A `Government Stamp Facts` @desc The stamp or instrument, and what the accused did with it and knew of it
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sells a counterfeit Government stamp` f IF
        "Whoever"
    AND f's `sells or offers for sale the stamp`
    AND f's `knows or has reason to believe the stamp to be a counterfeit`
    AND f's `a stamp issued by the Government for the purpose of revenue`

@export Whether the accused has committed an offence punishable under section 258 of the Penal Code 1871 (sale of counterfeit Government stamp)
